Commercial use, resale rights, redistribution rights, rehosting rights, paid integration, private business use beyond personal/local analysis, or permission to build derivative products requires written permission from Christopher Bostrom.

Permission must be granted in writing. Silence, repository access, Discord access, Patreon support, payment, or possession of source code does not create commercial permission.

