If you submit code, documentation, bug reports, feature ideas, tuning logic, pull requests, or other contributions to AeroTune, you grant Christopher Bostrom permission to use, modify, publish, distribute, and incorporate those contributions into AeroTune.

Submitting a contribution does not grant you ownership of AeroTune and does not create resale, redistribution, rehosting, or commercial rights.

